# 18. Complexity Goal

Try to achieve:

| Operation | Target Complexity |
| --------- | ----------------: |
| `SUBMIT`  |          **O(1)** |
| `NEXT`    |          **O(1)** |
| `RESOLVE` |          **O(1)** |
